OL,3,GNEWSACouncil agrees #2m to tackle EHCP
OL,4,Aassessment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is planning to spend #2m on
OL,7,Ftackling its growing assessment backlog
OL,8,Ffor children with special educational
OL,9,Fneeds and disabilities (SEND).
OL,11,FCambridgeshire County Council said
OL,12,Fhundreds of children had been waiting
OL,13,Falmost two years for Education, Health
OL,14,Fand Care Plan (EHCP) assessments.
OL,16,FBetween January and July this year, the
OL,17,Fauthority received 1,459 requests for
OL,18,FEHCP assessments but issued 675,
OL,19,Faccording to a council report.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
