OL,3,GNEWSACouncil agrees #2m to tackle EHCP
OL,4,Aassessment delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FEdna Murphy, chair of the council's
OL,7,FChildren and Young People Committee,
OL,8,Fsaid: "We know that the council's
OL,9,Fperformance on EHCP assessments has not
OL,10,Fbeen good enough."
